<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_d1726b14-a0a1-43e0-a99c-0edae616b8d3"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1993-109"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Wagga
Wagga Racecourse Act 1993</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b27671e0-a012-4190-9e30-e5361bca38b0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_7b16d9c4-8b9c-4e8a-8963-d00565fc9e16"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on a day to be appointed by
proclamation.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6afee3bb-7fc1-4df2-85ef-4b5cd587cd07"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_4ff4c4a5-7702-4f24-964b-2ee9bf8f99df"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_ccbb436b-ed9a-4bc1-b592-37d4b45495ec"
id="def.assets"><b><i>assets</i></b></defterm> means any legal or equitable
estate or interest (whether present or future and whether vested or
contingent) in real or personal property of any description (including money),
and includes securities, choses in action and documents.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_ab77ffd3-dc09-46ad-9865-ad4fc681b2c2"
id="def.liabilities"><b><i>liabilities</i></b></defterm> means all
liabilities, debts and obligations (whether present or future and whether
vested or contingent).</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_060b0adc-d5a2-4f7e-91a4-3bc0869b66ec"
id="def.rights"><b><i>rights</i></b></defterm> means all rights, powers,
privileges and immunities (whether present or future and whether vested or
contingent).</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_1925126e-ba65-4439-950f-c24a1a22aa6e" id="def.theformerClub"><b><i>the
former Club</i></b></defterm> means the members of the unincorporated body
known as the Murrumbidgee Turf Club.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_607c8dd5-66a3-4954-a80d-d6ccd7375d3f"
id="def.theformertrustee"><b><i>the former trustee</i></b></defterm>, in
relation to Wagga Wagga Racecourse, means the trustee for the Racecourse
holding office under Division 4 of Part 5 of the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1989-006"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown
Lands Act 1989</i></name></legref> immediately before the commencement of this
Act.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_7ac13527-171e-4147-82a3-945832f1382f"
id="def.theincorporatedClub"><b><i>the incorporated Club</i></b></defterm>
means the body corporate declared by the Minister under this Act to be the
incorporated Murrumbidgee Turf Club.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_1c6d78bb-6c44-4159-aeee-efeae7432319"
id="def.WaggaWaggaRacecourse"><b><i>Wagga Wagga Racecourse</i></b></defterm>
means the land described in Schedule 1.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3a530f41-3a1b-4cdf-9057-c7cfa784ff90"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_dc4cfa79-0dde-4e8d-af11-25a5dc3ffb28"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Status of racecourse</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_70587b64-6bfe-4339-ab67-f52e9346d286"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Wagga Wagga Racecourse continues, on and from
the repeal day, to be Crown land that is dedicated for the following purposes
under the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"
refid="act-2016-058"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Land Management Act
2016</i></name></legref>:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_55789206-a980-40d4-996e-a175bb977373" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">for use as a racecourse,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_78d25447-4839-4f93-9209-12ad2ec1880f" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">for use as a training ground,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_dee7bcfc-3486-4585-9929-7a980adc4a9a" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">for use as a sports ground,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2e3913ac-2d44-47d9-97b0-84b713a692fb" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">for any other form of public amusement or public
purpose (whether or not related to sports) that the Governor has, by order
published in the Gazette (whether before or after the repeal day), declared to
be a form of public amusement or public purpose for which the Racecourse or a
specified part of the Racecourse is permitted to be
used.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_659af93b-1bfa-4cdf-aac3-860b16bd8dde"
id="sec.4-ssec.1-note"><heading guid="_244986cf-d0f3-4dec-a72d-9186f1cda9f6"
id="sec.4-ssec.1-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">Clause 11 of Schedule 7 to the <legref
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-2016-058"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Land Management Act 2016</i></name></legref> operated
on the repeal day:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3700bc95-9a75-4966-877f-c115cf4e1421" id="sec.4-ssec.1-note-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to abolish the Wagga Wagga Racecourse Reserve
Trust, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f0c68887-ff8d-4d4a-a4e7-8ae35c8fe66e" id="sec.4-ssec.1-note-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to replace it with a statutory land manager under
that Act, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_70de37d5-42c4-4132-8b7e-4364fe052a80" id="sec.4-ssec.1-note-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to appoint the members of the trust board of the
Wagga Wagga Racecourse Reserve Trust as members of the board of the statutory
land manager, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d67af269-5ce2-4144-b5c4-3c7919aaf582" id="sec.4-ssec.1-note-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to appoint the statutory land manager as the
Crown land manager of the Wagga Wagga Racecourse.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></note>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f6d5ab97-2ec1-43fd-9dbf-5623c92dc8de"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsection (1) does not limit or prevent the
revocation of the dedication of the Wagga Wagga Racecourse, or the removal,
alteration or addition of purposes for which it is dedicated, in accordance
with the provisions of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"
refid="act-2016-058"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Land Management Act
2016</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_eb8fa8e1-9a1d-4a7e-abc1-fb952d5572dd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_cc5252af-be6d-44e5-aa95-bbbbf299fe99"
id="sec.4-def.repealday"><b><i>repeal day</i></b></defterm> means the day on
which the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"
refid="act-1989-006"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Lands Act
1989</i></name></legref> is repealed by the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown" refid="act-2016-058"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Land
Management Act 2016</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 4:</b> Subst 2017 No
17, Sch 2.19 [1].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5" status="repealed">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7b8511a8-f29e-4753-a370-8fce5123b705"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib>
<attrib name="status" value="repealed"></attrib></parentattributes>

