</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_031d1b6a-c1df-4e29-9b15-f79a16a3d354"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_2dd71b9e-1dd7-4a24-9b4e-17a452b07b99"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Incorporation of the former Club</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f0884006-9d04-4221-b714-f1b9d737e67d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Murrumbidgee Turf Club Act
1876</i></name></legref> prevents the former Club from being incorporated
under any law enabling persons to form a body corporate.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_62c5be7c-bec5-40b7-b654-d5bb40e701ce"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">On being satisfied that the former Club has
become incorporated as a body corporate, the Minister must, by notice in
writing published in the Gazette, declare the body corporate to be the
incorporated Murrumbidgee Turf Club for the purposes of this
Act.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_65c7c68d-d894-4c07-8fdc-a1fdf69f9a00"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_db76170f-8940-4a6d-bb20-e7928ab0351b"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Assets, rights and liabilities of the former Club to vest in
the incorporated Club</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c06704f1-1398-4cb2-871c-26654e2e668a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">On the date of publication of the notice referred
to in section 6, the following provisions have effect:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d871b5dc-a747-41fc-8596-7038b7575e97" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the assets of the former Club vest in the
incorporated Club by force of this section and without the need for any
conveyance, transfer, assignment or assurance,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7bdf4f87-7e07-49b5-9e2b-b6fcd7b93206" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the rights and liabilities of the former Club
become by force of this section the rights and liabilities of the incorporated
Club,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5acad94d-bde7-4322-a073-f20a054054e8" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all legal proceedings by or on behalf of, or
against, the former Club begun before, and pending immediately before, that
date are taken to be legal proceedings pending by or on behalf of, or against,
the incorporated Club,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7db4c956-e80e-42e2-bafd-9a56f2f9b056" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any thing done or omitted to be done in relation
to the former Club before that date by, to or in respect of that Club is, to
the extent that it continues to have effect, taken to have been done, or
omitted to be done, by, to or in respect of the incorporated
Club,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c1265cbc-b8b6-42f3-9f63-f5aeb06a4f27" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a reference in any Act, or any document
(including an instrument made under an Act), to the former Club is, subject to
any regulations in force under section 9, to be read as, or as including, a
reference to the incorporated Club.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_69422c18-4ac6-4bef-a695-fbd034bf30fb"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section, the assets of the former Club
include any lease of the Wagga Wagga Racecourse to the chairman of the former
Club that was in existence immediately before the date referred to in
subsection (1).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b5db5407-1feb-4914-abf6-5d297f901e5f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The operation of this section is not to be
regarded:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b4c3e8f2-5f45-49e1-9a4b-8f59d4f9ab3d" id="sec.7-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">as a breach of contract or confidence or
otherwise as a civil wrong, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f3975ccd-3de6-4230-8b13-f97275785256" id="sec.7-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">as a breach of any contractual provision
prohibiting, restricting or regulating the assignment or transfer of assets,
rights and liabilities, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e4cec28e-9150-46a4-b2ce-e00d10ace075" id="sec.7-ssec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">as giving rise to any remedy by a party to an
instrument, or as causing or permitting the termination of any instrument,
because of a change in the beneficial or legal ownership of any asset, right
or liability.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_994723f4-7bfc-43c6-b3db-a9a251e96b52"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The operation of this section is not to be
regarded as an event of default under any contract or other
instrument.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a47e8b6b-6d74-47c3-9548-4964ede3088a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">No attornment to the incorporated Club by a
lessee or sublessee from the former Club is required.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


