<head>
<no><b>Schedule 1</b></no><heading
guid="_dc209ec2-8539-411b-a25b-88edf418eeeb" id="sch.1-he"><b>Wagga Wagga
Racecourse&#8212;description of land</b></heading></head>
<block align="right" type="sourceref"><txt>(Section 3)</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1">The land comprising the Wagga Wagga Racecourse is
as follows:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="1">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8dc61593-49bd-48b9-a4fb-323eacafcfee" id="sch.1-para1">
<block><txt break.before="1">All that parcel of land at Wagga Wagga in the
City of Wagga Wagga, Parish of South Wagga Wagga, County of Wynyard, of about
60.26 hectares comprising the remainder of portion 209 of the Parish and
contained in Certificate of Title Volume 15139 Folio 250 at the Land Titles
Office, Sydney.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>
</content>


